{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/bef3a7502219d35cf17732cb7fc75c48.avif?t=1761352241\" width=733 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/97f0b62285c425c3c972f2fee69466e2.webp?t=1761352241\" width=513 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A challenging first-person survival horror game with no combat, no safety, and no escape - unless you endure long enough to awaken six hidden sigils in a desolate realm of fog and shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/65027db644993db446890c854bfe4366.webp?t=1761352241\" width=419 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a hostile, fog-filled world with no weapons or allies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rely on three fragile &amp; fleeting spells - lucent, descry, and ward. Each with their own cost and risk.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and activate six hidden sigils to awaken the Tree of Life.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the hunt in a world designed to keep you forever.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric and challenging survival horror with no combat - only endurance.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/7997e48d7a58b23d42bfd45b94556e12.webp?t=1761352241\" width=160 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped in a lightless realm, you must rely on your limited spells and fleeting moments of safety to find and activate all six sigils scattered around the map. Only then can you awaken the Tree of Life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/906cdf3444999165d50bd96c986b3709.poster.avif?t=1761352241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/906cdf3444999165d50bd96c986b3709.webm?t=1761352241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9b639ad413c1ad84d710f0ada460e255.webp?t=1761352241\" width=211 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are alone, unarmed, and hunted. The only tools at your disposal are three spells, each limited and costly.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Each spell cast may guide you closer to escape, or beckon the dread to you. Only by strategically using your spells and activating the sigils  can you break free. Sacrifice is inevitable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucent \u2013 Cast light to pierce the dark and charge the sigils.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/38435a1fea439d49ec571b31ac939030.poster.avif?t=1761352241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/38435a1fea439d49ec571b31ac939030.webm?t=1761352241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descry \u2013 Reveal hidden sigils and truths.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/09ac1a4d1123ca7d5ce5db6b0d7760ac.poster.avif?t=1761352241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/09ac1a4d1123ca7d5ce5db6b0d7760ac.webm?t=1761352241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ward \u2013 Raise a shield to endure a moment longer.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/32a486dff43f0677048707d862e44560.poster.avif?t=1761352241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/32a486dff43f0677048707d862e44560.webm?t=1761352241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas